---
import Prose from '../../components/Prose.astro';
import { t, paths } from '../../i18n/strings';
import { site } from '../../data/site';

const s = t('en');
---

<Prose lang="en" alternate={paths.pt.privacy} title={s.privacy.title} lead={s.privacy.updated} back={{ href: paths.en.home, label: s.privacy.back }}>
  <p>
    This policy explains how Be For You handles information from visitors to this website, in accordance with Brazil’s
    General Data Protection Law (LGPD, Law No. 13,709/2018).
  </p>

  <h2>Contact form</h2>
  <p>
    The form on this site does not store any data. When you send it, your message opens in WhatsApp or your email app,
    and you decide whether to send it. Information we receive through those channels is used only to reply to you and
    prepare a proposal.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use analytics tools (such as Google Analytics and Meta Pixel) only if you accept cookies in the notice shown on
    the site. They help us understand which pages are visited and improve our content. You can change your choice at any
    time under “Cookie preferences” in the footer.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can request access to, correction or deletion of your data, as well as information about how it is processed, by
    emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
  </p>
</Prose>
